Package: zuxmltable
Title: Registered-Table Consumer Fixture for zuxml
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes zuxml through its registered C
    function table, the way new C code is meant to: Imports plus LinkingTo in
    DESCRIPTION, an importFrom() directive in NAMESPACE, and every call made
    through zuxml_api_get(). It calls all 26 members of the table, so that a
    broken resolver, a reordered member or a header that states its contract
    wrongly is discovered here rather than downstream. Its sibling,
    tools/zuxmltest, covers the other consumption mode: the static archive.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: zuxml
LinkingTo: zuxml
